  "customfield_10187": null,
  "description": {
   "content": [
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Aaron Coburn reported to me that there is a problem with ",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "marks": [
        {
         "attrs": {
          "href": "https://github.com/fcrepo4/fcrepo4/blob/master/fcrepo-http-commons/src/main/java/org/fcrepo/http/commons/api/rdf/HttpResourceConverter.java#L91-L92"
         },
         "type": "link"
        }
       ],
       "text": "this regex",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "content": [
        {
         "text": "In that regular expression, there's a \"\\w\" for matching a hash URI. That regex class is defined to include the following character ranges: A-Z, a-z, 0-9 and the _",
         "type": "text"
        },
        {
         "type": "hardBreak"
        },
        {
         "text": "As it turns out, though, there are many other legitimate characters that can be part of a hash URI, most notably, the - character, which incidentally is used for any blank-node skolemization.",
         "type": "text"
        }
       ],
       "type": "paragraph"
      },
      {
       "content": [
        {
         "text": "To reproduce this, just create a resource with this RDF:",
         "type": "text"
        }
       ],
       "type": "paragraph"
      },
      {
       "content": [
        {
         "text": "<> <",
         "type": "text"
        },
        {
         "marks": [
          {
           "attrs": {
            "href": "http://purl.org/dc/terms/subject"
           },
           "type": "link"
          }
         ],
         "text": "http://purl.org/dc/terms/subject",
         "type": "text"
        },
        {
         "text": "> [ a <http://example.com/Subject> ] .",
         "type": "text"
        }
       ],
       "type": "paragraph"
      },
      {
       "content": [
        {
         "text": "Then, try to version that resource. You can't. This will be a pretty significant gotcha for anyone who happens to rely on bnode skolemization in fedora.",
         "type": "text"
        }
       ],
       "type": "paragraph"
      }
     ],
     "type": "blockquote"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Verified, by myself.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "curl -i -XPUT -ufedoraAdmin:fedoraAdmin ",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "marks": [
        {
         "attrs": {
          "href": "http://localhost:8080/fcrepo/rest/test_regex"
         },
         "type": "link"
        }
       ],
       "text": "http://localhost:8080/fcrepo/rest/test_regex",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "text": " -H\"Content-type: text/turtle\" -d\"<> <",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "marks": [
        {
         "attrs": {
          "href": "http://purl.org/dc/terms/subject"
         },
         "type": "link"
        }
       ],
       "text": "http://purl.org/dc/terms/subject",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "text": "> [ a <http://example.com/Subject> ] .\"",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "HTTP/1.1 201 Created",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "curl -i -XPOST -ufedoraAdmin:fedoraAdmin ",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "marks": [
        {
         "attrs": {
          "href": "http://localhost:8080/fcrepo/rest/test_regex/fcr:versions"
         },
         "type": "link"
        }
       ],
       "text": "http://localhost:8080/fcrepo/rest/test_regex/fcr:versions",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "HTTP/1.1 400 Bad Request",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "Server: Apache-Coyote/1.1",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
